# Found by search 2026-11-21 to settle two report claims the fact sheets did not address (Iowa Title 10/32 tax, Utah waiver and AGR).
# JUR=IA SRC=https://tax.iowa.gov/node/4717/printable/print OPENED=2026-11-21 PAGE_UPDATED=none
INCTAX|Guard and Reserve active duty pay exclusion (Title 10 status; Title 32 full-time Guard not included)|ad,ng,rsv|res & ad|Iowa residents in the armed forces, the reserve or the National Guard in an active duty status as defined in 10 USC 101(d)(1); full-time National Guard members under Title 32 (AGR) are not in an active duty status, so their pay is not excluded|Federal active duty pay excluded from Iowa tax|PAGE

# JUR=UT SRC=https://ut.ng.mil/Portals/40/STW_Application%2024-25%20school%20year_1.pdf OPENED=2026-11-21 PAGE_UPDATED=none
